# Luau style

- Prefer typed Luau (`name: string`, return types on public APIs).
- Get services once at module top: `local Players = game:GetService("Players")`.
- Prefer small ModuleScripts in `shared/` over giant scripts.
- Use `task.` APIs (`task.spawn`, `task.delay`, `task.wait`) — not legacy `wait`/`spawn`.
- Match StyLua (tabs, 120 cols) and keep Selene clean.
